t","block_id":"vhxj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4a3678a5-8715-4490-aaec-cfe40d0a8b17","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"shellescape()","ts":"1621386038.112900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4TEhG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e69e5414-65b2-4168-aec8-0a7c08571b15","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"ファイル名が `[id].tsx` なものについて\n`call system('git add ' . a:file)` してもaddされないんですが、これってどうやって対応するのがよさそうでしょうか","ts":"1621385985.112700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RwiL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"41B156D4-8035-441B-9CB6-EAA43FA6F134","type":"message","user":"UBQ2H65JQ","text":"Plugのとこは入れたいプラグインマネージャーとプラグイン名に読み替えて下さい","ts":"1621376642.111500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sdRSX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"90895E0E-674C-4AB0-9957-F1B93CEB8F84","type":"message","user":"UBQ2H65JQ","text":"なので、\n```\nif has('nvim')\n  Plug 'xxx/yyy'\nelse\n  Plug 'xxx/zzz'\nendif\n```\nとすれば切り替えができるかと","ts":"1621376595.110300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WQH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7FDDE7BA-4C1A-4A8F-B7EE-93ACC7591C34","type":"message","user":"UBQ2H65JQ","text":"`if has('nvim')`\nでneovimかどうかの判定ができます。","ts":"1621376479.108100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cHm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5ab00805-5ded-4534-878c-ac8df5e091fe","type":"message","user":"U015QS1HT41","text":"朝早くからこんにちは\n自分は主にneovim nightly(ver5↑)を使ってはいるものの普通のvimも一応使っています\nnvim専用プラグインである\u003chttps://github.com/nvim-telescope/telescope.nvim|telescope\u003eだったり\u003chttps://github.com/romgrk/barbar.nvim|barbar\u003eだったり\u003chttps://github.com/lewis6991/gitsigns.nvim|gitsigns\u003eだったりをfzf-previewやairlineのbarやgitgutterの代わりに利用してます\nそこでvim側でも後述したfzf-previewなりを使えるようにif文みたいな感じでneovimとvimでプラグインをこっちならこれ(neovimならbuild in lspでvimならcoc)みたいな感じでできるのでしょうか？\nまたその方法はベターなのでしょうか？それともnvimはinit.vimなりinit.luaに記述してって具合に両方分けるべきでしょうか？","ts":"1621375754.106700","thread_ts":"1621375754.106700","attachments":[{"fallback":"GitHub: nvim-telescope/telescope.nvim","id":1,"title":"nvim-telescope/telescope.nvim","title_link":"https://github.com/nvim-telescope/telescope.nvim","text":"Find, Filter, Preview, Pick. All lua, all the time. - nvim-telescope/telescope.nvim","image_url":"https://opengraph.githubassets.com/2063b240f0816b8e56e13da98122f7b45b2389a4bf8eca00a31c671f1d0be6f4/nvim-telescope/telescope.nvim","blocks":null,"service_name":"GitHub","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/github.png","from_url":"https://github.com/nvim-telescope/telescope.nvim","original_url":"https://github.com/nvim-telescope/telescope.nvim"},{"fallback":"GitHub: romgrk/barbar.nvim","id":2,"title":"romgrk/barbar.nvim","title_link":"https://github.com/romgrk/barbar.nvim","text":"A neovim tabline plugin. Contribute to romgrk/barbar.nvim development by creating an account on GitHub.","image_url":"https://opengraph.githubassets.com/ab8a53bf47c8f3d200cca229979f28c68778036db3b9de808a4d38a812b93a49/romgrk/barbar.nvim","blocks":null,"service_name":"GitHub","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/github.png","from_url":"https://github.com/romgrk/barbar.nvim","original_url":"https://github.com/romgrk/barbar.nvim"},{"fallback":"GitHub: lewis6991/gitsigns.nvim","id":3,"title":"lewis6991/gitsigns.nvim","title_link":"https://github.com/lewis6991/gitsigns.nvim","text":"Git signs written in pure lua. Contribute to lewis6991/gitsigns.nvim development by creating an account on GitHub.","image_url":"https://opengraph.githubassets.com/a0b99dabc7e73ee32a5f9dd242871b95530a8a63d11ede933ee56cededa60346/lewis6991/gitsigns.nvim","blocks":null,"service_name":"GitHub","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/github.png","from_url":"https://github.com/lewis6991/gitsigns.nvim","original_url":"https://github.com/lewis6991/gitsigns.nvim"}],"reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dRNw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e8c36e5f-05e8-4f16-ae84-4b1348393707","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"色関係がちゃんと設定できてるかどうかの確認方法からしてわからないのですが、bashの中で↓のコマンド流すとグラデーションになってますが、`winpty nvim`してから`:term bash`の中で流すとグラデーションにならずになんか緑色過多っぽい感じになります\n\u003chttps://www.pandanoir.info/entry/2019/11/02/202146|https://www.pandanoir.info/entry/2019/11/02/202146\u003e","ts":"1621350919.098000","attachments":[{"fallback":"Panda Noir: TrueColor対応のはなし(端末、シェル、tmux、vim) - Panda Noir","id":1,"title":"TrueColor対応のはなし(端末、シェル、tmux、vim) - Panda Noir","title_link":"https://www.pandanoir.info/entry/2019/11/02/202146","text":"TrueColorで表示しようとすると、わりかし対応がめんどうです。なぜなら、Vim、tmux、zsh、ターミナル全てで対応しなければならないからです。今回はそれぞれどういった対応をすればいいのか紹介します。 対応できているか確認する まず以下のコマンドを実行してみてください。 $ curl -s \u003chttps://gist.githubusercontent.com/lifepillar/09a44b8cf0f9397465614e622979107f/raw/24-bit-color.sh\u003e | bash このように継ぎ目がなければOKです。 下のように階段状になっていたら対応できていません。…","image_url":"https://cdn-ak.f.st-hatena.com/images/fotolife/p/panda_noir/20191106/20191106185205.png","blocks":null,"ts":1572693706,"service_name":"Panda Noir","service_icon":"https://www.pandanoir.info/icon/touch","from_url":"https://www.pandanoir.info/entry/2019/11/02/202146","original_url":"https://www.pandanoir.info/entry/2019/11/02/202146"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EjfPa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"365aa400-23e6-4daa-896c-d464488da87b","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"色が変になったりならなかったりでいまいち再現性がよくわからないのですが、画面描画が色々おかしい（色が指定と違う、画面更新でゴミが残るなど）くて困っています","ts":"1621350412.097900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UUiX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ee14660f-e66b-42f4-963d-ef1ef31